        "id": 5166,
        "name": "CrosshairCollie",
        "username": "CrosshairCollie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/crosshaircollie/{size}/2828_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-09-04T04:21:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This is probably a really stupid question, but there was some debate at the table last night.  I apologize for not being able to remember the name of the card in question, but it was one of Tachyon’s cards and I think Visionary’s power.</p>\n<p>The card says to draw 3 cards, then discard 2 cards.  Do the 2 cards discarded have to be chosen from the cards drawn by the effect, or can you discard any two cards in your hand?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:34:44.894Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 2,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 10.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 5165,
        "topic_slug": "draw-x-cards-discard-x-1-cards",
        "display_username": "CrosshairCollie",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
