        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "This is probably a really stupid question, but there was some debate at the table last night.  I apologize for not being able to remember the name of the card in question, but it was one of Tachyon's cards and I think Visionary's power.\n\nThe card says to draw 3 cards, then discard 2 cards.  Do the 2 cards discarded have to be chosen from the cards drawn by the effect, or can you discard any two cards in your hand?",
